  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Catch-up education to out of school children in disadvantaged communities and transition to formal education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide accelerated model primary education programme to reach disadvantaged out-of-school children (OoSC) between the ages of 7 and 14 who have dropped out of primary school providing an accelerated course for 10 months before re-enrolling them into regular schools.</narrative>
  </description>
